# The documentation site (#103). It is published from a workflow rather than
# from a branch, so nothing it generates belongs in the tree.
# `site/package-lock.json` is the deliberate exception and is committed: the
# workflow installs with `npm ci`, which requires it, and a lockfile is what
# makes two builds of the same commit the same site.
/site/node_modules/
/site/dist/
/site/.astro/
